From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
d3drm: texture decal and cache settings, device update callbacks and settings

Textures keep the decal scale, transparent colour, cache options and
downsample/validation callbacks; devices keep update callbacks (run by
Update), buffer count, shades and texture quality.
